# Route: guide 37 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 55 to
# 57, 40 quests, 3.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Eastern Plaguelands, Hillsbrad Foothills, Western Plaguelands,
# Tirisfal Glades): Light's Hope Chapel -> The Infectis Scar -> Light's Hope
# Chapel -> Corin's Crossing -> Darrowshire -> Light's Hope Chapel -> The
# Marris Stead -> The Undercroft -> The Fungal Vale -> Lake Mereldar ->
# Light's Hope Chapel -> Quel'Lithien Lodge -> Terrordale -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee...
# (6135; Duskwing 60); The Corpulent One (6136; Borelgore 61); The Crown of
# Will (518; Crushridge Mauler 36-37).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Dawn's Gambit (4771), The Flesh Does Not Lie (5212), The
# Active Agent (5213), The Great Fras Siabi (5214), Houses of the Holy (5243),
# The Archivist (5251), Above and Beyond (5263), The Restless Souls (5282),
# Menethil's Gift (5463), Plagued Hatchlings (5529), Ramstein (6163), Dead
# Man's Plea (8945), Anthion's Old Friend (8948), The Grave Knight (96986),
# Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384),
# The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of
# Love and Family (5848), Oculus Illusions (6569), Vorrel's Revenge (1051),
# Barov Family Fortune (5341), The Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), The Wrath of
# Rath'mael (92422), Crest of Lordaeron (95204), Unending Torment (97288).

